      "message": "why are we explicitly enabling this for entry into ct_try_snk?  Shouldn\u0027t it have come from a state that already had SOP\u0027 enabled?  It\u0027s not like we enforce the other state requirements if they\u0027re redundant from previous states (such as isolation)...\n\nIn the same vein, the assumed state could probably be better documented in comments.",
